"Torsten Klein teaches offensive combat at Celena North High."
"He has salt-and-pepper hair, blue eyes and a strong jaw, and doesn't blink commanding the System."
"His motto is Horses not unicorns; he told Alden one skill is not enough for hero work."
"He teaches single-target offense in first-year hero PE, and called Alden a time waster."
"He is a middle-aged Agility Brute with the skill Instant Corners and a floating-block spell."
"He tells students: the enemy is the question; you must strive to be the answer."
"In the Matadero flood he led his class across The Span, vowing nobody gets left alone."
"An official emergency summons pulled him away mid-crossing."
"He doubts Rabbit skills can make Alden danger-ready, and suggested he skip the combat term."
